WEBVTT

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:44.950
"Animal Mask x MAO"

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:47.540
It's time for the main event!

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:50.450
Will this bring an end to their long rivalry?

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:54.120
What kind of match do they have
in store for us tonight?

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:57.830
"Animal Mask vs MAO"

00:02:02.450 --> 00:02:05.200
It's finally time...

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:30.290
Knock it off!

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:36.540
If I can pin my hated foe, Animal Mask,
to the mat in this match...

00:02:39.370 --> 00:02:42.750
MAO, it's time.

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:43.950
Right!

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:50.200
So it's finally time...

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:52.500
Making his entrance into the arena,

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:54.540
it's the knight who always
counts his wins and losses,

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:59.160
weighing in at 178 pounds,
the Macadamian Ogre!

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:02.330
AKA MAO!

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:04.700
Hell yeah!

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:06.580
The man who loves animals a little too much!

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:12.370
Weighing in at 198 pounds,
it's Animal Mask!

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:14.160
It's finally time...

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:17.200
Will MAO get his revenge?

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:23.790
Animal Mask, today I'm
sending you to your grave!

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:35.000
Today's the day! Today's the day!

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:40.080
Today's the day... I defeat you!

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:43.120
And now he's jumped!

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:48.660
They've started to glow!

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:50.750
What is this?

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:54.040
They disappeared!

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:56.120
What is this?

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:59.700
Animal Mask has disappeared!

00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:03.620
What?

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:15.160
Animal Mask!

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:17.040
Where the hell did you go?

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:19.620
"Animal Mask Disappears During Fight"

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:21.080
"Animal Mask Disappears:
Part of the Show?"

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:21.080
He ran from the fight!

00:04:22.370 --> 00:04:25.120
If a guy runs from a title match,

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:28.540
I'm gonna call him a chicken nugget!

00:04:28.540 --> 00:04:30.120
MAO, you can just call him a chicken.

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:31.330
You don't need the nugget part.

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:33.910
Nobody cares!

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:35.700
Hey, Animal Mask!

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:40.450
What kind of wrestler runs
'cause he's scared of losing a fight?

00:04:40.450 --> 00:04:44.120
Get back here and finish this!

00:05:07.290 --> 00:05:10.790
Where'd he go, though, really?

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:13.830
Animal Mask...

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:15.450
Genzo...

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:19.700
Well, who cares!

00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:23.290
My job is women's pro wrestling now!

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:26.250
"MAO Enraged"

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:29.160
"'Where Did You Go, Animal Mask?'"

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:32.830
Genzo!

00:05:32.830 --> 00:05:35.870
Eat up, and grow up big and strong!

00:05:35.870 --> 00:05:37.500
Genzo!

00:05:35.870 --> 00:05:37.500
Eat up, and grow up big and strong!

00:05:45.290 --> 00:05:47.580
He won't even pick up the phone!

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:49.080
This is getting bad!

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:52.250
Find him a new opponent!

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:55.660
He says he doesn't want to fight
anybody but Animal Mask.

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:59.620
It's true. Animal Mask is
the only guy he's never beaten.

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:02.000
"Interdimensional Title Match"

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:02.000
It's true. Animal Mask is
the only guy he's never beaten.

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:06.040
"Animal Mask Entrance Theme"

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:06.040
What do we do, though, really?

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:47.080
"Grand Opening"

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:49.410
We just did a remodeling!

00:06:51.250 --> 00:06:54.080
Animal Mask...

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:58.160
Where did you go?!

00:07:04.370 --> 00:07:05.540
Genzo!

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:07.160
There you are.

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:08.580
I've been looking for you.

00:07:08.580 --> 00:07:13.000
Can you go without me today?

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:14.290
Again?

00:07:14.290 --> 00:07:15.620
What are you saying?

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:19.000
I want to stay here, where Masao needs me!

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:23.290
He's asleep.

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:25.870
For now, yes.

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:27.410
But think about it.

00:07:27.410 --> 00:07:29.290
He hasn't been here long at all.

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:32.540
If I'm not here when he wakes up...

00:07:43.950 --> 00:07:47.330
What if that happens, Shigure?

00:07:48.700 --> 00:07:51.160
I'm not sure how you want me to answer that.

00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:53.660
I want to be by his side
every waking moment,

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:56.120
at least until he gets used to his new home.

00:07:56.120 --> 00:08:00.120
But cu sith don't even get along
with humans, they say.

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:03.200
I don't think he'd make a good pet, do you?

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:08.330
So this will be a long-term project, then.

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:11.080
Hey. Were you listening to me?

00:08:11.080 --> 00:08:13.290
Now, no more excuses.

00:08:13.290 --> 00:08:14.660
It's not an excuse!

00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:16.660
Right, right. Let's go!

00:08:16.660 --> 00:08:18.950
Wait! Wait, Shigure!

00:08:18.950 --> 00:08:22.040
Stop it! Wait, Shigure!

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:23.450
Demon! Monster!

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:24.660
Stop it!

00:08:24.660 --> 00:08:27.870
Hiroyuki, hold down the fort!

00:08:27.870 --> 00:08:29.370
We're heading out!

00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:32.500
Masao!

00:08:33.750 --> 00:08:35.660
The others are waiting for us.

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:38.620
Let me go, Shigure!

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:38.620
The others are waiting for us.

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:41.450
They finally left, huh?

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:43.790
I thought we wouldn't get a shot today.

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:46.790
Are we really doing this?

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:49.410
I've never seen that beast before.

00:08:49.410 --> 00:08:54.200
I can't imagine how much
some rich weirdo will pay for it!

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:56.540
We've got no choice but to take it!

00:08:56.540 --> 00:08:59.870
But what if he comes back?

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:03.830
I think we'd be better off just
staying away from that pervert.

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:08.540
You fool! I need to get my revenge!

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:11.660
For what he did to me...

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:13.870
What he did to you?

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:20.870
Mischa, you just remembered it, didn't you?

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:25.330
Stop! Stop! Don't remember!

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:27.540
Don't laugh!

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:29.080
I'm sorry!

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:30.370
Let's do this!

00:09:30.370 --> 00:09:31.870
Right!

00:09:32.950 --> 00:09:34.950
Is this really going to work?

00:09:34.950 --> 00:09:39.080
Don't worry about if it'll work. Make it work!

00:09:39.080 --> 00:09:40.450
Right, right.

00:09:40.450 --> 00:09:42.750
So what's the plan?

00:09:42.750 --> 00:09:46.410
Listen. I've got the perfect plan.

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:52.040
First, we use this expensive ham
to lure him over.

00:09:52.040 --> 00:09:53.000
Think that'll work?

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:56.950
And then we lure him outside...

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:59.330
We lure him over, and once he's close,

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:01.500
you grab him with the bag,

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:03.000
and we split!

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:04.250
Perfect, right?

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:05.830
I don't know...

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:06.700
Let's go!

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:07.910
Okay!

00:10:07.910 --> 00:10:10.620
I hope this works...

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:33.200
I don't see the dradradogola anywhere.

00:10:33.200 --> 00:10:34.160
Yeah.

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:36.700
Is it really out here?

00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:40.200
Yes, according to the clerk at the guild...

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:41.700
You sure it's not bad info?

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:44.950
There's no food here either.
What should we do?

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:49.870
Leave it to me, Mistress!

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:51.540
Wait...

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:53.660
I have a bad feeling.

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:55.580
Let's head back.

00:10:55.580 --> 00:10:58.160
There you go again...

00:10:58.160 --> 00:11:00.450
No, it's true.

00:11:01.410 --> 00:11:04.290
It's some kind of message
from the spirit world,

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:08.540
telling me that something horrible
might've happened to my beloveds!

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:13.620
I can smell your lies.

00:11:13.620 --> 00:11:15.750
You're saying it's a bad feeling,

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:20.250
but you're actually just not interested in
the dradradogola 'cause it's a plant.

00:11:20.250 --> 00:11:21.370
No!

00:11:21.370 --> 00:11:24.700
This is how it was with Keiko, remember?

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:27.370
It was a lie when you said that
about Toshihiko, right?

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:33.040
I'm back.

00:11:37.330 --> 00:11:39.370
Gang! Mischa?!

00:11:44.330 --> 00:11:47.250
What happened to you?

00:11:47.250 --> 00:11:50.410
Edgar, well...

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:54.040
Bro came up with the idea
of stealing that little beast

00:11:54.040 --> 00:11:58.410
from the pervert to teach him a lesson...

00:11:59.870 --> 00:12:02.500
And you two morons did it without telling me?

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:06.000
I told him you wouldn't like it, but he...

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:15.660
I'll finally get the chance to see him in tears.

00:12:15.660 --> 00:12:18.040
I hope so.

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:19.450
Okay, let's go.

00:12:19.450 --> 00:12:21.290
Right...

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:29.660
Okay, come on!

00:12:29.660 --> 00:12:30.580
Mischa!

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:32.790
Ready whenever!

00:12:45.250 --> 00:12:48.660
He's kind of cute, huh?

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:53.540
What are you doing, bro?

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:56.000
We need to get him in the bag!

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:57.540
Yummy, isn't it?

00:12:57.540 --> 00:13:00.950
Bro, wake up! Don't give into temptation!

00:13:00.950 --> 00:13:02.660
Bro!

00:13:02.660 --> 00:13:05.160
Bro, we need to hurry!

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:08.910
He's just so cute, though!

00:13:08.910 --> 00:13:11.160
My bro...

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:38.120
I survived 'cause I'm
a fast runner, but my bro...

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:43.830
An ant... a huge ant... save me...

00:13:43.830 --> 00:13:48.290
Sheesh. Looks like he's got
more trauma to deal with...

00:13:54.120 --> 00:13:56.290
That scream was a dradradogola!

00:13:56.290 --> 00:13:57.540
What? A voice?

00:13:57.540 --> 00:13:59.040
From which way?

00:14:00.830 --> 00:14:03.450
That way!

00:14:03.450 --> 00:14:05.620
So there are demon beasts here!

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:08.750
What dummy said there weren't?

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:23.250
Genzo, what's wrong?

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:25.580
Did the dradradogola get him?

00:14:25.580 --> 00:14:27.870
You finally died, huh, Genzo?

00:14:27.870 --> 00:14:29.790
I'm so disappointed!

00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:34.500
What? Nobody said that thing
was carnivorous!

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:38.120
Genzo!

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:39.290
Don't worry.

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:42.290
I'll make your corpse serve me forever!

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:46.830
Genzo?

00:14:46.830 --> 00:14:49.040
He's alive, huh?

00:14:49.040 --> 00:14:52.910
Hey, these are plants after all.

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:59.200
You don't have to get so disappointed.
It's our job.

00:14:59.200 --> 00:15:03.910
Their terrible screams made you
pee your pants though, I bet.

00:15:03.910 --> 00:15:05.410
It's our job, okay?

00:15:05.410 --> 00:15:09.040
You guys take over. I'm going home.

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:12.830
I know they're not animals,
but could you at least try?

00:15:15.160 --> 00:15:17.120
Cowardly human!

00:15:17.120 --> 00:15:18.830
Shut up, vampire.

00:15:18.830 --> 00:15:22.700
I'm not the noble creature they call a vampire!

00:15:25.450 --> 00:15:27.870
Look at this one!

00:15:27.870 --> 00:15:29.450
Isn't it kind of cute?

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:33.580
Cute? Shigure, I think your eyes are broken.

00:15:33.580 --> 00:15:34.540
Are you okay?

00:15:34.540 --> 00:15:37.290
Not now!

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:40.040
See, Genzo?

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:43.290
Not cute at all.

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:45.330
Is so!

00:15:45.330 --> 00:15:47.330
I said it's not cute and it isn't.

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:49.000
It's creepy.

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:50.700
I'm leaving.

00:15:50.700 --> 00:15:53.870
Wait! We're not done here...

00:15:55.500 --> 00:16:00.330
Shigure, I thought you understood.

00:16:00.330 --> 00:16:02.580
Understood what?

00:16:02.580 --> 00:16:04.540
Money doesn't move me.

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:08.540
I act out of one thing only:
my overwhelming love for animals!

00:16:08.540 --> 00:16:14.040
Yeah right, Genzo. I bet you like
money as much as you like animals.

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:17.750
No! That is not true at all!

00:16:17.750 --> 00:16:20.540
Enough talking!

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:23.620
Let's just do our jobs!

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:28.250
The dradradogola's voices...

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:29.830
They all...

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:31.790
...stopped.

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:39.620
Hanako, did you...?

00:16:45.660 --> 00:16:47.700
We're back.

00:16:47.700 --> 00:16:53.870
What? Hiroyuki was almost kidnapped,
but you fought the kidnappers off?

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:57.500
So, what did they look like?

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:09.910
Listen, I'll take my time in coming up
with a way to get back at that pervert.

00:17:09.910 --> 00:17:11.790
Until we're ready, stay put!

00:17:11.790 --> 00:17:13.000
Okay...

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:16.370
I'll never go after him again...

00:17:16.370 --> 00:17:17.950
Hey!

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:26.620
It was you?!

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:33.700
You scared my partner, did you?

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:38.080
I was willing to let you go
because you were fluffy, but...

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:42.620
It looks like you need to learn your lesson!

00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:45.950
And learn it hard!

00:17:58.160 --> 00:17:59.910
Listen up!

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:05.200
Never touch my Hiroyuki again!

00:18:36.330 --> 00:18:38.000
Yes!

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:55.250
It's been a while since I've
done anything like wrestling.

00:18:55.250 --> 00:18:58.330
Since my last bout, huh?

00:19:02.040 --> 00:19:03.910
Shut up!

00:19:06.120 --> 00:19:09.410
Leave me alone, damn it!

00:19:09.410 --> 00:19:11.000
MAO!

00:19:20.870 --> 00:19:24.370
You've got Animal Mask withdrawal.

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:26.620
Withdrawal?

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:30.660
You're too obsessed with Animal Mask.

00:19:30.660 --> 00:19:32.120
That's impossible.

00:19:32.120 --> 00:19:35.080
He ran from me 'cause he was
scared of losing!

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:38.160
That's called being obsessed.

00:19:39.370 --> 00:19:42.330
You need to take up a new hobby.

00:19:42.330 --> 00:19:45.870
Something that'll take your mind off things.

00:20:01.160 --> 00:20:03.200
Damn it all!

00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:14.080
Princess Altena of Edgardo is believed
to have summoned a hero.

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:16.450
This is a serious threat.

00:20:16.450 --> 00:20:23.580
Thus, I, next leader of the vampires
and one of the four Dukes of Darkness,

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:27.790
asked the Demon King for
permission to defeat the hero.

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:33.330
What we are summoning here is
the Demon King of another world.

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:38.620
And with the help of that Demon King,
I will defeat the hero!

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:46.540
Darkness of the dark, give us power!

00:21:04.870 --> 00:21:08.540
Animal Mask...

00:21:22.500 --> 00:21:24.700
He's here!

00:21:36.540 --> 00:21:41.250
I am one of the four Dukes of Darkness,
servants of the Demon King.

00:21:41.250 --> 00:21:45.120
Daughter of Valei Joannascore Adorian Uljika.

00:21:45.120 --> 00:21:48.620
Joanna Joannascore Adorian Uljika!

00:21:48.620 --> 00:21:53.040
Demon King of another world,
brought here by the dark gods of darkness...

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:56.870
Help us defeat the hero!

00:21:59.540 --> 00:22:03.410
What is your name?

00:22:03.410 --> 00:22:05.620
MAO.

00:22:07.660 --> 00:22:11.540
So you're the Demon King
of another world, huh?

00:23:45.910 --> 00:23:49.910
Next Time: "Loser x Master."
